\ Phase 4 Slice 6e dogfood: `if` in a polymorphic body. `mymax`/`choose` each
\ branch once; `mymax3` nests an `if` inside an `if` arm, checking D4's claim
\ that nested `if` falls out of the recursive poly-walk rather than needing a
\ dedicated mechanism.

import: intrinsics * ;
import: core::prelude * ;    \ Bool comes through here, the prelude's own re-export.

\ P7.S3s (R7): neither `mymax` nor `mymax3` is `inline` any more. `Ord` is a
\ library trait now, so `'T: Copy Ord` is a `Bound::User`, and a combinator's
\ own type variable may carry none (`reject_user_bound_on_combinator`: a
\ combinator is spliced at its call sites and records no instantiation a
\ trait bound could resolve against). Both are therefore ordinary generic
\ bodies forwarding `'T: Copy Ord` to the non-inline library `gt` -- the
\ cross-call forwarding case R2 closes -- at the cost of a real call frame
\ per instantiation.
: mymax ( 'T: Copy Ord 'T -- 'T ) over over gt ~[ drop ] ~[ swap drop ] if ;

: choose inline ( 'T 'T Bool -- 'T ) | a b flag | flag ~[ a b drop ] ~[ b a drop ] if ;

: mymax3 ( 'T: Copy Ord 'T 'T -- 'T )
  | a b c |
  a b gt ~[
    a c gt ~[ a ] ~[ c ] if
  ] ~[
    b c gt ~[ b ] ~[ c ] if
  ] if ;

: main ( -- )
  2 5 9 mymax3 .
  2.0 5.0 9.0 mymax3 . ;
